# Disable all end-of-line conversion.
#
# artifacts/MANIFEST.md records the sha256 of every released artifact, and
# release_tools/make_manifest.py verifies those hashes against the files in a
# checkout. If Git rewrote line endings on checkout, the bytes on disk would
# no longer match the bytes that were hashed and verification would fail on
# Windows while passing on Linux.
#
# The patch files under patches/ have the same requirement: they are unified
# diffs against LF-normalized upstream sources and must not be rewritten.
#
# Everything in this repository is committed with LF, so disabling conversion
# gives every platform a byte-identical working tree.
* -text
